      "writtenOn": "2018-07-09T19:09:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, this might clean up some of the interface concerns I have.\n\nA lot of what is being proposed carries some of the confusing practices we had with the token provider API, which we\u0027re still trying to fix after years of refactoring.\n\nI\u0027d hate to have auth receipts start on the same foot only to be confusing to understand and implement out of the gate due to the patterns we implemented a long time ago :(",
      "parentUuid": "5f7c97a3_30861e67",
      "range": {
