      "lineNbr": 28,
      "author": {
        "id": 2903
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-07-06T18:09:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggest not basing this on a dict. This should be an object in it\u0027s own right, using @property/@settr/etc. See Lance\u0027s new TokenModel.\n\nThis is to prevent lazy dict referencing and can ensure we are parsing the date data a single time (stored locally). The render to JSON [if ever?] should be explicit as would be conversion to a SQL Model.\n\nThis comment is highly relevant to the -1 score.\n\nRelated: once a recepit is minted (see lance\u0027s token rework) it should be immutable.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 28,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 28,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "4106cf58ee51c5cf249bb53364f110dc2f0cdc7e",
