      "writtenOn": "2018-07-06T18:09:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NOTE: If a receipt is not found, we need to make sure it turns into an Unauthorized not just a 404 (during the auth bit).\n\nRelated: Can receipts *ever* be validated independantly. I don\u0027t think they should be able to be, therefore this being an actual 404 is almost not needed. I would probably subclass ReceiptNotFound from Unauthorized and never risk bubbling up a 404 instead of a 401.",
