      "message": "AFAIK we\u0027re doing it wrong in keystone NotImplemented is HTTP-Method specific, aka: HTTP GET/PUT/ETC not implemented. This likely should cause a 500 error [the only case where a 500 is expected] and raise NotImplementedError",
