      "writtenOn": "2018-07-09T19:09:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From the perspective of someone trying to implement this interface, I have no idea what this means. A lot of what we\u0027re doing here is *very* similar to the patterns we had in the token provider APIs for years, which made that API ridiculously complicated to understand.\n\nI fear recreating that complexity here by using those practices.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "4106cf58ee51c5cf249bb53364f110dc2f0cdc7e",
