      "writtenOn": "2018-07-09T19:09:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A dictionary of what? Even if we\u0027re only implementing a single pluggable solution, we should try and write this interface as if *everyone* wants to provide their own.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 44,
        "endChar": 31
